"""End-to-end worker: runs the official swegemma two-phase pipeline (agent in sandbox A, hidden-test
verification in sandbox B) for a slice of (arm, task) jobs against a running local vLLM server.

  python run_e2e.py --jobs jobs.json --worker 0 --nworkers 8
